# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Discover named GenericChoice modes reached through SubAbility.
# Forcing: Casting Dance with Calamity must publish its two real choices.
# AI behavior: No opposing permanents or hand cards affect resolution.
# Failure modes: Missing catalog modes terminate the match; successful decline
# leaves one exiled card, the resolved sorcery in the graveyard, and priority.
# Card roles: Eight Mountains pay for Dance; identical library Ornithopters make
# the shuffled first exile deterministic. The hand Ornithopter keeps priority live.
# Protocol path: Cast, CastingTimeOptionsReq, Repeat optional, Play optional, priority.
[metadata]
Name:Subability modal choice
Goal:Survive
Turns:5
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Exile one card with Dance with Calamity, stop repeating, then decline to cast it.

